Package: fwckreport
Title: Fresh-Weight Inhibition vs CK with Dunnett
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: person("Ming", "David", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "placeholder@example.com")
Description: Turn pot-trial fresh weight into inhibition vs CK and Dunnett contrasts; optional one-page HTML report. Supports asymmetric dilution-series design (wide treatment columns + no-dose control). Free core; paid seats buy written judgment receipts, not analysis ops.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: multcomp, dplyr, readr
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, rstatix
